# Pairs with PeerAuthorityBounded. Prepare skips the hosting gate, so a peer picks
# a cluster-local tree as the target the shadow cutover overwrites.
MODULE: PeerRestoreSkipsHostingGate
TARGET: PeerAuthorityBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a prepare builds a tree this cluster does not replicate under peer authority
PERTURBS: Prepare

--- FIND
Prepare(ch, bound, claimed, ts, b) ==
    LET t == Members(ts)
--- REPLACE
Prepare(ch, bound, claimed, ts, b) ==
    LET t == ts
--- END
